# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) to override dev behavior. All keys must be VITE_-prefixed
# to reach the client bundle.

# Coach LLM in dev:
#   By default, `npm run dev` uses a FREE LOCAL LLM (Ollama, model qwen2.5:14b) — no tokens, no
#   password. See the README "Team Coach in dev" section for setup.
#   Set this to 1 to instead use the real Gemini proxy in dev (then the normal password login
#   applies, and requests count against the Gemini free tier). Leave unset for local-LLM mode.
# VITE_COACH_PROXY=1
